// canonicalPackageCallbackInfo, and what only it reaches
//
// The frame a package's progress callback gets while it is read in
// (src/stores/LargeObjects.cpp): the package's name and size, its parts,
// the part being read and how much has been read.

canonicalPackageCallbackInfo := {packageName: nil, packageSize: 0, numberOfParts: 0, currentPartNumber: 0, amountRead: 0};
